WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:05.840
hug 13 "fu-fu-fuuuun ♪"

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.010
Um...

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:30.610
Almost Christmas, huh?

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.570
I'm looking forward to it. Aren't you?

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.950
Mitsuya Production
Junta Azumaya

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:36.120
How do you usually spend Christmas, Takato?

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:38.950
How?

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:40.700
Nitto Talent Agency
Takato Saijo

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.000
Working, of course.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.870
When you get to be an actor at my level,

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:46.330
you're so busy that you don't have time
to be interested in Christmas.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:47.540
Really?

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:52.220
But this year, you only have one photo shoot
for a magazine on Christmas,

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.590
so you can take it easy, right?

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:55.840
How do you know my schedule?!

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:57.550
It was Mr. Sasaki again!

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:01.020
I can't wait to spend Christmas Eve
with you, Takato!

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.270
Well, I guess I'll go along
with whatever you've got.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.810
You're reading "aniani"?

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:09.730
My manager, Mr. Taguchi, gave it to me.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.190
He said I'm in it.

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:13.070
Huh.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:14.490
What's this?!

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:18.240
#1 JUNTA AZUMAYA

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:18.240
RANKING OF MEN YOU WOULD LIKE
TO SPEND CHRISTMAS WITH

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:18.240
"Men You Would Like
to Spend Christmas With"?!

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.490
Yeah, a new ranking.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.330
Women like that kind of thing.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:27.790
<i>I'm in second place. Second place again.</i>

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:32.210
I'll prepare for Christmas, so leave it to me!

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.340
I'll do it.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.970
I'll plan Christmas.

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:40.350
But are you sure?

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.810
You've only ever worked on Christmas, right?

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:44.430
There's nothing I can't do!

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.350
Just watch.
I'll make this an awesome Christmas,

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:49.610
the likes of which the world
has never seen before!

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:52.360
Okay. I'm looking forward to it.

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:58.320
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.580
<i>I haven't been able to prepare
for Christmas at all.</i>

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.910
LIMITED TIME
ILLUMINATION EVENT
INFORMATION

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:05.500
<i>I did a lot of research, but all
of the options were somewhat lacking.</i>

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:09.170
Takato, is everything ready?

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:11.670
You bet!

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:52.940
Nice! Nice! Takato, you're the best!

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:51.730
Photographer
Jurio Mitsudani

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.480
<i>That's right. I'm the best.</i>

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:58.190
<i>But as for Christmas...</i>

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:03.030
<i>I enjoyed it as a kid,
but about ten years after leaving home,</i>

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:07.160
<i>I had no lover, no friends,
and was up to my neck with work.</i>

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.870
<i>After I got through work,
I'd go home alone and catch my breath.</i>

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:15.250
<i>Lately, I've treated Christmas itself
as if it were a dead person,</i>

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:19.340
<i>acting as if it didn't even exist this time of year.</i>

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:23.970
<i>So I'm a beginner at Christmas,
but I refuse to let myself lower the bar!</i>

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:27.890
<i>I need to do something
that makes his jaw drop!</i>

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:31.850
Takato, more tempestuous! More sensual!

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.940
<i>More! More!</i>

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.190
Ecstasy!

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.650
That'll do it.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.530
I got a lot of great shots.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.740
Thank you so much!

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.320
No, thank you.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.200
You really did great work.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:52.250
I feel like you've become even dreamier lately.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.330
Like you've got even more sexual allure.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:59.050
Just looking at you through the viewfinder
got me aroused!

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:02.840
It's all thanks to your skill as a photographer.

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:06.800
No, it's the pheromones
oozing out from deep inside your body!

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:11.850
It seems you've got someone
who's good at bringing out that side of you.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:15.560
Bringing out?
No, I haven't the slightest idea what you mean.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:20.780
It's Christmas Eve tonight.
Have a lovely evening.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:25.030
Yes. The shoot finished early.

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:27.780
Yes, I'm at the cafe downstairs.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.620
<i>I'm not doing this to copy anyone.</i>

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:37.210
<i>This is just to get some idea
about what average people do on Christmas.</i>

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:39.540
<i>No. I can't arrange it in time.</i>

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.050
<i>No. My pride wouldn't allow it.</i>

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:45.050
<i>No! I can't play the guitar!</i>

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:48.430
Knitting?

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.640
Yeah. We match.

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:51.640
Newlywed couple
Miki

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:51.640
Newlywed couple
Tomo

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:55.020
Is it too embarrassing?

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:57.350
Don't wear it if you don't want to.

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.310
It's super warm, Miki.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.150
I love you, Tomo!

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.610
<i>I thought matching outfits were ridiculous,</i>

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.820
<i>but maybe it works, depending on
the person's character and situation.</i>

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:11.530
<i>So Christmas is a time for dramatics.</i>

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.830
<i>Drama! That's it.</i>

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:17.170
<i>Am I not the mega-popular actor,
Takato Saijo?</i>

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:21.750
<i>As I've appeared in any number
of trendy dramas, I'm a love story expert.</i>

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.760
<i>If I just put into practice
a Christmas as depicted in dramas...</i>

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.680
<i>The situation in which I set
the most hearts beating fast...</i>

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:30.510
<i>That one!</i>

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:34.020
<i>I'll take him to the middle
of a busy intersection,</i>

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:35.430
<i>where I set that up beforehand.</i>

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:38.020
YOU'RE MY ANGEL

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.020
An illuminated message
that would make anyone swoon!

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:39.810
How about that?!

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:41.730
Well...

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:43.270
I guess.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:45.360
You think like a virgin.

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:46.190
- What?!
- What?!

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:46.190
Kaitei Private High School Third year
Student Council President
Seigo Takahara

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:48.860
If I were your girlfriend, I'd be like,

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:50.200
Kaitei Private High School
First Year Photography Club
Yuya Fujisaki

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:51.320
"Well, he's really into it."

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:55.910
If I were your girlfriend, I'd make like I
didn't notice and pretend I wasn't with you.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:54.410
Kaitei Private High School
First Year No Club
Yukio Ninomiya

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:00.790
But this issue of "DT Days" says that would
make your girlfriend fall madly in love with you.

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:01.880
Nah, nah, nah.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.750
Seigo, you shouldn't read that magazine.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:08.590
DT DAYS

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:07.090
Just from the name alone, I can tell it's evil.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:08.590
Oh.

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:11.720
Sorry.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:17.140
To be honest, as your younger colleague,
if you did that for me, I'd be touched. Besides...

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:21.730
The least we can do is keep you warm
somehow on Christmas Eve.

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.780
Sorry!

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.450
Huh? Takato Saijo!

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.030
Excuse me. Good luck.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.660
He's so cool.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.250
He isn't one of the Sexiest Men
of the Year for nothing.

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:41.330
One of the sexiest men, huh?

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:43.080
One of the sexiest men.

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:45.250
So not a virgin.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.800
Like a virgin. Like a virgin.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.640
Like a virgin.

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:53.970
Takato, good to see you.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:55.600
Takato Saijo's Manager
Takumi Sasaki

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:58.100
G-Good evening.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:06.110
You're not sure what to do for Christmas, huh?

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:08.900
But the important thing is the feeling behind it,

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:11.530
so I think Azumaya would be pleased
with anything you plan.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.660
No, that's not the problem.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.370
So what time are you meeting up?

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:19.040
You have a plan to meet Azumaya
tonight, right?

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:22.960
No. Come to think of it, where is he?

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.840
<i>Working?</i>

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:31.930
Mr. Sasaki, did you hear from him earlier?

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:36.100
Not a word about abducting...
that is, picking you up today.

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:38.430
Where is he?

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.770
Why don't we go look for him at Mitsuya Pro?

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:45.610
Azumaya has today off.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.150
Off?

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:49.860
Do you know where he is?

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:55.660
No. I don't really know
what he does during his private time.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.370
What's this?

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.910
What's this about my Jun?

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.910
Junta Azumaya Manager
Mamoru Taguchi

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.910
Mitsuya Production CEO
Romio Mitsudani

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.910
Don't be creepy, Boss.

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:05.500
Apparently they can't get ahold of Azumaya.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:08.840
Hey, what did you do to Jun?!

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.420
I haven't done anything.

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.880
Do something!

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:15.640
Don't you dare leave him alone
on Christmas Eve!

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.550
If it were me, I'd embrace him, cling to him,

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:20.180
wrap my arms and legs around him,
not let go for one moment!

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:21.430
So creepy.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:27.360
So you take good care of my Jun!

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:32.320
You changed Jun, so you take
full responsibility, Takato Saijo!

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:36.780
The president of that agency
certainly is unique.

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:38.320
<i>Off today?</i>

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:42.160
<i>He took Christmas Eve off,
but doesn't answer when I call?</i>

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:43.330
Well, shall we go?

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:46.790
You're worried about Azumaya, right?

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.880
Let's look for him in the likely places.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:49.750
But...

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.880
You're always so focused on work,

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:55.470
that it kind of makes me happy to see you
doing your best to enjoy Christmas.

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:57.140
Mr. Sasaki.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:00.260
Where should we start?

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:02.020
Then...

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:08.150
<i>This is where it began for us.</i>

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:15.610
<i>Where we first met.</i>

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:17.950
Chun...

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:19.490
Takato. Are you shooting?

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:21.080
Mr. Usaka.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.450
No, today is...

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:27.040
Looking for someone on Christmas?

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.830
Having no way to contact
the person beforehand.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:30.130
TV-J General Producer
Kazuomi Usaka

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:32.420
For everything except for work,
you really are a goofball.

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:37.720
Well, I'm sure it can all be smoothed over
if you give the person a decent present.

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:38.760
P-Present?!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:42.680
Don't tell me you didn't even prepare
a Christmas present?

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:45.060
Oh, please!

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:48.310
Incidentally, what's something
that you would like, Mr. Usaka?

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:50.270
What I would like...

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:55.150
A great project and great ratings.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.030
That's very like you.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:59.860
<i>A present!</i>

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:02.660
<i>What does he want?!</i>

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:08.210
If he's not at work, maybe we should
check out the usual restaurants he frequents.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.080
Do you know Azumaya's favorite food?

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:15.010
He likes to eat... Fresk mints.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:15.960
What else?

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:17.880
Also...

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:22.720
<i>Fresk is the only thing I can think of!</i>

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.680
<i>H-Huh? I don't know anything about him.</i>

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:30.560
Is it him?!

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:32.690
No, it's Nana...

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:34.690
asking if it's time for Christmas cake.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:38.070
Thank you, Mr. Sasaki.

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:42.200
Rina and Nana are waiting for you,
so please go home.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.030
But...

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.080
I want to find him myself.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.000
I see. Good luck, Takato.

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.420
Hiding in plain sight.

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:57.960
Not here either?

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:02.390
<i>It smells like him.</i>

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:05.890
Where did he go?

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.600
The movies, dramas, magazines I was in...

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:14.560
He even has my kid roles.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.270
Stalker.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:20.030
But that's how he knows so much about me.

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.200
Hey, taxi!

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:28.330
<i>I'll tackle the present later.
If I don't manage to see him tonight...</i>

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:32.000
<i>Wait for me, Chunta.</i>

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:36.250
<i>I swear I'll find you and give you a Christmas
so awesome it'll make your head spin!</i>

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:39.920
Cold.

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:42.720
Takato Saijo?

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:44.510
Unusual for him to be alone.

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:49.850
Independent
Photographer
Jiro Hasegawa

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.110
<i>Wait and see, Chunta.</i>

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.110
<i>I'll find you in no time.</i>

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:02.820
- What do you wanna eat?
- Let's start with...

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:04.860
<i>If I search every last possible place
I have in mind...</i>

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:04.860
Come on, Maron.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.450
<i>I haven't found him.</i>

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:19.090
<i>Damn it. Now I'm pissed!</i>

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:22.090
<i>Why do I have to search for him
in the first place?!</i>

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:27.600
<i>The hell with Christmas! I've had enough!
Pain in the ass!</i>

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:33.100
This Ryota guy thought Christmas
was a pain in the neck,

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:36.020
so he didn't make a date
or buy a present or anything last year.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.860
So his girlfriend was furious.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.860
Ryo Narumiya Manager
Yoko Sugita

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.860
Galaxy Agency
Ryo Narumiya

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:39.690
Oh, dear.

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:42.530
They had a huge fight
about whether to break up or not.

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:46.110
She called him "the lowest of the low,"
as if he were a criminal!

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:52.000
<i>If you don't do anything for Christmas,
it's a sin?!</i>

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:56.250
<i>I'm a sinner.</i>

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.460
Huh? Mr. Saijo?

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.420
It's Mr. Saijo!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:05.880
Hi, Narumiya.

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:09.220
So what happened to that Ryota?

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.010
He got dumped.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:16.060
<i>Would he dump me?</i>

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:17.020
<i>There's no way!</i>

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:18.860
<i>After all that stalking he did...</i>

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:22.690
<i>But if I don't find him...</i>

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:24.940
Wait a second!

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:28.070
Japan Arts Enterprise
Chihiro Ayagi

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:28.910
Christmas Eve, and I'm working my ass off.

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:31.490
What am I doing to myself?

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:32.870
Ayagi!

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.290
Mr. Saijo!

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:37.290
Maybe it's worth working on Christmas Eve
if I can see Mr. Saijo.

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.080
Wha— Hey! What?!
This is bold of you!

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:41.540
Ayagi! Where would you go
on Christmas Eve?!

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:43.250
Where?!

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.800
W-Well, I would, um...

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.130
Spit it out!

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:50.430
If I were with you,
I wouldn't care where we went.

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:52.970
<i>By the way, Chihiro Ayagi,</i>

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:56.270
<i>I've heard rumors that you
slept your way up the ladder.</i>

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.440
What's that?

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:58.900
N-Nothing.

00:14:58.900 --> 00:14:59.900
What's this?

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:01.190
Ms. Kurokawa.

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:03.650
You're not with Azumaya tonight?

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:05.240
You switched to another boy?

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:08.490
Platinum Agency
Yurie Kurokawa

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:09.200
Or maybe Azumaya got fed up with you?

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.080
What are you talking about?

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.080
<i>He's fed up with me?!</i>

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.960
Your sweetheart ran out on you
on Christmas Eve?

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:17.790
Mr. Nakata?!

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:20.670
I feel sorry for you, Saijo.

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:23.550
It's not like that. I don't have a sweetheart.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:27.010
Sorry I'm late, Yurie. Were you waiting long?

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:27.010
Office Yen Agency
Kozaburo Nakata

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.510
I just got here, Kozaburo.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:32.550
Are you going on a date?

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:33.640
Yes.

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:34.720
That's right.

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:38.770
Da... A date on Christmas Eve?!
Then you two are a couple?

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:39.980
For tonight.

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:42.650
I might be with someone else tomorrow.

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:44.730
That's your rep.

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:47.650
Tomorrow is tomorrow. Tonight is tonight.

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:51.870
We're both serious about dating various people.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:53.410
Right, Yurie?

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:56.370
Yes. For an actress, romance is essential.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:16:00.790
If you go out with a lot of people,
your performances have more depth.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:04.250
Going from one person to the next...

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.760
It's all I can do
to have feelings for one person.

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:10.550
W-What?!

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.970
It seems you're devoted to this "one person."

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.060
That's cute.

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:19.270
Saijo, give it your best shot.

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:22.400
Give my regards to this person
you have feelings for.

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:24.230
Have a lovely Christmas.

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:29.110
She is the romantic expert
who livens up the TV gossip shows.

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:31.780
Show business is full of scoundrels.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:33.620
I'm...

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:34.660
I'm also...

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:40.830
He's definitely crafty.

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:48.000
He's not alone.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:50.800
<i>There's just one more place I can think of.</i>

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:55.800
<i>His favorite place...</i>

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:02.940
Christmas alone again this year?

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:11.070
Sorry I've had you drive me all over the place.

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:13.200
How much do I owe you?

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:15.200
1,000 yen.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:17.200
Here.

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.620
Chunta.

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:26.880
How?!

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:29.800
AZUMAYA TRANSPORTATION

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.800
I was a cabbie for a while a long time ago.

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:34.880
Chunta, you're telling me
you were with me all this time?

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:36.140
Yes, the whole time.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:40.100
Thanks to that,
I was able to see your various expressions.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:42.980
Takato?

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:44.060
Ow!

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:46.690
You! You stalker angel!

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:48.650
Do you know what you put me through?!

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:51.530
I'm sorry. But I was touched.

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:53.820
Because you searched for me.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:18:00.620
I'm always chasing after you,
so I wanted you to think about me for once.

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:03.790
Chunta.

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:07.920
Please accept this Christmas present from me.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:24.350
What is this?

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:25.850
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:30.110
Wait. Did you do this?

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:34.440
Yes. I was once a lighting designer.

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:35.450
And also...

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.360
You're cold, aren't you?

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.280
Have some warm hot chocolate.

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:42.080
I made it the way you like it.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:45.500
Made?! You made this yourself?

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:46.620
Yes. From cocoa beans.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:47.460
From cocoa beans?!

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.290
And also, a travel voucher for Hawaii.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:50.920
Hawaii again?!

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:55.550
This time not for work, but a leisurely private
vacation that just the two of us can enjoy.

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:56.630
And also...

00:18:58.180 --> 00:18:59.260
How many are there?!

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:04.310
I was thinking that I wanted to please you,
and somehow that thought led to all these.

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:09.190
<i>The man I would like to spend Christmas with...</i>

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:12.110
<i>I would never be satisfied with number two.</i>

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:13.270
<i>But...</i>

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:15.400
I bet you're hungry.

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:18.240
I've got a lot of good food and booze
prepared at my place, so—

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.110
Chunta.

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:22.450
M-Merry...

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:26.120
C-Chri...

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.750
I-I'm trying to say...

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:29.750
Yes?

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.130
Merry Christmas.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:41.720
Could you say that again?

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:44.060
Brace yourself!

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:49.560
<i>He's number one for...</i>

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.110
W-Wait!

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:10.960
Takato, this is the best Christmas I've ever had.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.840
A kiss from you...

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:17.460
it's a marvelous Christmas present.

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:19.010
Y-Yeah, right?

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:21.220
No one is better at doing Christmas than me.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:25.140
You made this much hot chocolate?

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:27.350
Yes. I thought maybe we could use it for play.

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:28.180
Play?

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:31.190
We did it with honey before, remember?

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:32.940
We can do it with chocolate, like fondue.

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:33.940
That's not fondue!

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:36.230
Whoa, wait.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:38.650
You have dinner prepared at your place, right?

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:41.990
No feast could be better than you, Takato.

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:45.030
Thank you for this meal.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:50.460
Cut it out, you insatiable angel!

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.500
Takato. Takato.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.510
It's morning. If you don't wake up...

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:07.680
Knock it off! First thing in the morning...

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:08.520
What?

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:13.480
Good morning, Takato.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:19.650
Good... morning.

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:23.820
- Well, I have to go to Studio B.
- Right.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:25.990
Takato.

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:31.620
I intend to do everything I can
to be your "Sexiest Man of the Year"...

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.630
for next year and the year after, too,
so prepare yourself.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:39.340
You're scary.

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:24.230
He really is scary!
